#: ../../source/docs/takeoff-landingpage.rst:5
#: 94aacd78d7164771b4d125a59f234b3d
msgid "Takeoff"
msgstr "起飞"

#: ../../source/docs/takeoff-landingpage.rst:7
#: a62de55e90d643cab711acc41cac67f3
msgid ""
"Taking the plane off can be accomplished in many ways: Rolling Takeoff, Hand"
" Launch, Bungee, or VTOL (Vertical Takeoff and Landing) if a "
":ref:`quadplane-support`. And it can be done manually or automatically."
msgstr ""
"飞机起飞可以通过多种方式完成：滑行起飞、手抛起飞、弹射起飞，或VTOL（垂直起降），如果支持 :ref:`quadplane-"
"support`。可以手动或自动完成。"

#: ../../source/docs/takeoff-landingpage.rst:10
#: 3663e0fa04b14c66b86eec65abaeb0aa
msgid "Rolling Takeoff"
msgstr "滑行起飞"

#: ../../source/docs/takeoff-landingpage.rst:12
#: a32795b94dd446398ff1eaa9a5cb8fd6
msgid ""
"In this case, the plane has landing gear with steerable nose gear, usually "
"coupled to the rudder control and the plane is usually launched from a "
"smooth grass or paved surface (see the `Ground Steering parameters "
"<https://ardupilot.org/plane/docs/parameters.html#steer2srv-parameters>`__ ."
" Once aligned nose into the wind, throttle is gradually increased to takeoff"
" value (usually full throttle) while the aircraft direction is controlled by"
" rudder. Once sufficient airspeed to lift off is obtained, slight up "
"elevator will rotate the nose to climb attitude."
msgstr ""
"这种情况下，飞机具有可转向的前轮起落架，通常与方向舵联动，飞机通常从平整的草地或铺装跑道起飞（参见 `Ground Steering "
"parameters <https://ardupilot.org/plane/docs/parameters.html#steer2srv-"
"parameters>`__）。迎风对准后，逐渐增加油门至起飞值（通常为全油门），同时用方向舵控制方向。一旦获得足够的离地空速，轻拉升降舵将机头旋转至爬升姿态。"

#: ../../source/docs/takeoff-landingpage.rst:14
#: 3e172d26b7f1460b92161b418a024c2f
msgid "MANUAL or FBWA modes are most commonly used during takeoffs."
msgstr "起飞时最常用的是 Manual 或 FBWA 模式。"

#: ../../source/docs/takeoff-landingpage.rst:16
#: 60c196822fc64d21b296864d4a94f045
msgid "For automatic takeoffs see :ref:`automatic-takeoff` section."
msgstr "有关自动起飞，请参见 :ref:`automatic-takeoff` 章节。"

#: ../../source/docs/takeoff-landingpage.rst:19
#: 9df12ea2540f4aa19642a738b2bc470c
msgid "Hand Launch"
msgstr "手抛起飞"

#: ../../source/docs/takeoff-landingpage.rst:21
#: 8e7ea4e3af464d81a63124be2e40aad4
msgid ""
"Many planes do not have landing gear, or a smooth runway is not available. "
"Hand launching is a very common takeoff method, but also can be very "
"frustrating if not setup and executed properly."
msgstr "许多飞机没有起落架，或者没有平整的跑道可用。手抛起飞是非常常见的起飞方式，但如果设置和操作不当也可能非常令人沮丧。"

#: ../../source/docs/takeoff-landingpage.rst:23
#: 3b5c0c8d6caf46c5a6a265a6d36ce775
msgid "The keys to a successful hand launch are :"
msgstr "手抛成功的关键："

#: ../../source/docs/takeoff-landingpage.rst:25
#: 8107542cb86b455c93a8aebfd9e577a1
msgid ":ref:`Proper CG <guide-center-of-gravity>`"
msgstr ":ref:`正确的重心 <guide-center-of-gravity>`"

#: ../../source/docs/takeoff-landingpage.rst:26
#: 4d4a911c070c497cad9d0c44b1b05879
msgid ""
"Having flying surfaces centered and neutral at neutral RC stick positions"
msgstr "在遥控摇杆中立位置时，飞行面居中且处于中立状态"

#: ../../source/docs/takeoff-landingpage.rst:27
#: e38e9338f311459bae6d6832663c6492
msgid ""
"Having the \"level\" calibration setup such that the level horizon (0 deg "
"pitch) in FBWA mode results in the wing chord line being a few degrees "
"positive, which will result in a positive angle of attack in \"level\" "
"flight, the normally cruising attitude for a plane."
msgstr "设置「水平」校准，使FBWA模式下水平地平线（0度俯仰）时机翼弦线保持几度正迎角，这将在「水平」飞行时产生正迎角，即飞机正常巡航姿态。"

#: ../../source/docs/takeoff-landingpage.rst:28
#: 6b65f48b51b54d45be850ffebcb10408
msgid ""
"Using FBWA mode or :ref:`automatic-takeoff`. While launching in MANUAL can "
"be done, using a stabilized mode will eliminate a lot of pilot effort to "
"overcome trim issues (see Tip at end of this page). If using FBWA mode, a "
"few degrees of up elevator (~10%) during the launch will result in an "
"automatic climb. Add this via a switch or stick pressure. Do not change TX "
"trim positions used during RC calibration since it affects all other modes "
"of flight."
msgstr ""
"使用FBWA模式或 :ref:`automatic-takeoff`。虽然在 Manual "
"模式下起飞也可以，但使用稳定模式可以减少飞手为克服配平问题所付出的努力（参见本页末尾的提示）。如果使用FBWA模式，在起飞过程中施加几度的上仰升降（约10%）将自动爬升。可通过开关或摇杆压力实现。请勿更改RC校准期间使用的遥控器配平位置，因为这会影响所有其他飞行模式。"

#: ../../source/docs/takeoff-landingpage.rst:29
#: 751f21075e45438485fbdde575667a0b
msgid ""
"Throttle up and firmly throw the plane level directly into the wind, not "
"nose pointed up. Common mistakes are pointing the nose up, throwing it "
"toward the ground, or rotating your wrist like a football throw. In the "
"first second or so, the plane has low airspeed and the flying surfaces have "
"no authority to correct non-level attitude until it accelerates to flying "
"speed."
msgstr ""
"加油门，平稳有力地将飞机直接迎风水平投出，而非机头朝上。常见错误包括：机头上抬、向地面方向投出，或像传橄榄球一样旋转手腕。在最初的一秒左右，飞机空速较低，飞行面在加速到飞行速度之前无法纠正非水平姿态。"

#: ../../source/docs/takeoff-landingpage.rst:32
#: cc1fca1129864081af42fac23281216c
msgid "Videos of hand launches"
msgstr "手抛起飞视频"

#: ../../source/docs/takeoff-landingpage.rst:39
#: 1a8347ec8c8e4016a9a12faeeb592b16
msgid "Bungee"
msgstr "弹射起飞"

#: ../../source/docs/takeoff-landingpage.rst:41
#: 97c675fea5d541b894b7628c0d7e4362
msgid ""
"Bungee launching involves using an elastic band, stretched and attached to "
"the plane, in order to provide a catapult-like takeoff."
msgstr "弹射起飞使用弹力绳，拉伸后连接到飞机，以提供弹射式起飞。"

#: ../../source/docs/takeoff-landingpage.rst:47
#: f036716414214d5fa8f8a2284084c9b3
msgid ""
"This is commonly used for very heavy or very high stall speed planes for "
"launching. A tutorial on building and using a bungee launcher is `here "
"<https://www.rcgroups.com/forums/showthread.php?1459906>`__"
msgstr ""
"这通常用于非常重或失速速度非常高的飞机起飞。关于制作和使用弹射起飞架的教程请见 `这里 "
"<https://www.rcgroups.com/forums/showthread.php?1459906>`__"

#: ../../source/docs/takeoff-landingpage.rst:51
#: 8dd6516f94974cc588ec9c4dbe7d778d
msgid "VTOL"
msgstr "VTOL"

#: ../../source/docs/takeoff-landingpage.rst:53
#: 834e8df1dde3422ba5229832cb5b3d22
msgid ""
"Perhaps the easiest of all takeoffs, it does require that the plane be a "
"VTOL capable :ref:`QuadPlane <quadplane-support>`"
msgstr "也许是所有起飞方式中最简单的，但需要飞机具备VTOL能力，即支持 :ref:`QuadPlane <quadplane-support>`"

#: ../../source/docs/takeoff-landingpage.rst:55
#: 0edd2aca1c6544b6b7da86655e16cee3
msgid ""
"While not necessary for a successful launch, enabling "
":ref:`SERVO_AUTO_TRIM<SERVO_AUTO_TRIM>` will automatically trim the plane "
"during stabilized operations, such that switching to MANUAL or ACRO mode "
"later will have an in-trim plane automatically."
msgstr ""
"虽然对于成功起飞并非必须，但启用 :ref:`SERVO_AUTO_TRIM<SERVO_AUTO_TRIM>` "
"将在稳定操作期间自动配平飞机，使得以后切换到 Manual 或 ACRO 模式时飞机自动处于配平状态。"

#: ../../source/docs/takeoff-landingpage.rst:57
#: f915c8baf32e40ea8727410a731df248
msgid ""
"The default PIDs usually will be acceptable for most planes for their first "
"launch. However, powerful, small flying wings will sometimes wobble in pitch"
" at high throttle climb-outs and can benefit from initially setting "
"``PTCH2SRV_P`` to half its default value. These can be optimized later "
"manually or using AUTOTUNE mode. See :ref:`tuning-quickstart`"
msgstr ""
"默认PID通常对大多数飞机的首次起飞已足够。但功率强劲的小型飞翼在大油门爬升时有时会出现俯仰抖动，可以通过将 ``PTCH2SRV_P`` "
"初始设置为默认值的一半来改善。这些参数之后可以手动优化或使用AUTOTUNE模式优化。参见 :ref:`tuning-quickstart`"
